{"id":"a4963e1943313e0a","group":"58","path":"58/batch05/58-df-zfc-graph-transitive-tournament.md","title":"ZFC Graph Transitive Tournament","display":"df-zfc-graph-transitive-tournament — ZFC Graph Transitive Tournament","type":"definition","metadata":{"type":"definition","book":"Set Theory","book_abbrev":"58","label":"58-df-zfc-graph-transitive-tournament","aliases":["58-df-zfc-graph-transitive-tournament"],"display":"df-zfc-graph-transitive-tournament — ZFC Graph Transitive Tournament","depends_on":["[[58-ax-zfc]]","[[../batch18/58-df-relation.md]]"]},"metadataError":null,"renderWarnings":[],"properties":[{"key":"type","html":"definition"},{"key":"book","html":"Set Theory"},{"key":"book_abbrev","html":"58"},{"key":"label","html":"58-df-zfc-graph-transitive-tournament"},{"key":"aliases","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span>58-df-zfc-graph-transitive-tournament</span></div>"},{"key":"display","html":"df-zfc-graph-transitive-tournament — ZFC Graph Transitive Tournament"},{"key":"depends_on","html":"<div class=\"property-array\"><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-1\" data-note=\"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" href=\"?note=a3348ed9eb6fb4e3\" title=\"58-ax-zfc\">58-ax-zfc</a></span><span><a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-2\" data-note=\"7ccfc8c88f29968a\" href=\"?note=7ccfc8c88f29968a\" title=\"../batch18/58-df-relation.md\">../batch18/58-df-relation.md</a></span></div>"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"T,X,E\\in V\">\\(T,X,E\\in V\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"E\\subseteq X\\times X\">\\(E\\subseteq X\\times X\\)</span></li>\n<li><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{ZfcGraphTransitiveTournament}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\">\\(\\mathrm{ZfcGraphTransitiveTournament}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}\\)</span></li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}graph\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}tournament}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcGraphTransitiveTournament}_S(T,X,E)\\leftrightarrow T=\\langle X,E\\rangle\\land E\\subseteq X\\times X\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\langle x,x\\rangle\\notin E)\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\left(x\\neq y\\to(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in E\\leftrightarrow\\langle y,x\\rangle\\notin E)\\right)\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in X\\;\\left(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in E\\land\\langle y,z\\rangle\\in E\\to\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in E\\right)\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}graph\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}tournament}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcGraphTransitiveTournament}_S(T,X,E)\\leftrightarrow T=\\langle X,E\\rangle\\land E\\subseteq X\\times X\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\langle x,x\\rangle\\notin E)\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\left(x\\neq y\\to(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in E\\leftrightarrow\\langle y,x\\rangle\\notin E)\\right)\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in X\\;\\left(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in E\\land\\langle y,z\\rangle\\in E\\to\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in E\\right)\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>A transitive tournament is an irreflexive complete orientation whose edge relation is transitive.</li>\n</ul>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"58-ax-zfc","status":"resolved","id":"a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[58-ax-zfc]]","embed":false},{"target":"../batch18/58-df-relation.md","status":"resolved","id":"7ccfc8c88f29968a","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[../batch18/58-df-relation.md]]","embed":false}],"math":[{"tex":"T,X,E\\in V","display":false},{"tex":"E\\subseteq X\\times X","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{ZfcGraphTransitiveTournament}_S:V^3\\to\\{\\top,\\bot\\}","display":false},{"tex":"\\mathrm{df\\text{-}zfc\\text{-}graph\\text{-}transitive\\text{-}tournament}\\vdash\\mathrm{ZfcGraphTransitiveTournament}_S(T,X,E)\\leftrightarrow T=\\langle X,E\\rangle\\land E\\subseteq X\\times X\\land\\forall x\\in X\\;(\\langle x,x\\rangle\\notin E)\\land\\forall x,y\\in X\\;\\left(x\\neq y\\to(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in E\\leftrightarrow\\langle y,x\\rangle\\notin E)\\right)\\land\\forall x,y,z\\in X\\;\\left(\\langle x,y\\rangle\\in E\\land\\langle y,z\\rangle\\in E\\to\\langle x,z\\rangle\\in E\\right)","display":true}],"bytes":1101,"backlinks":[{"id":"84daad544872cc71","anchor":"ref-2256","locations":["正文"],"count":1,"excerpt":"[[../batch05/58-df-zfc-graph-transitive-tournament.md|58-df-zfc-graph-transitive-tournament]]（batch05）"}],"outgoing":["a3348ed9eb6fb4e3","7ccfc8c88f29968a"]}